    "description": {
      "value": "As long as you have _The Tyrant_ invested, you gain a +2 item bonus to Intimidation checks made to Demoralize. This bonus increases to +3 if you are at least 17th level.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou hold the card up to your lips and exhale onto it; you cast dragon form. The level of the spell is half your level, rounded down (minimum 6th level)."
